<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>上下文管理 on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/tags/%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/</link><description>Recent content in 上下文管理 on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 14:55:05 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/tags/%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>多 Agent 协作的技术内核：价值来自结构，不是并发</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/multi-agent-technical-core/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 14:33:59 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/multi-agent-technical-core/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;多 Agent 系统的实际收益从不源于节点数量的盲目堆叠，而取决于拓扑结构的工程约束。缺乏严格职责边界与通信契约的多 Agent 系统只是昂贵的低效并发——成倍消耗 Token 并在链路中放大模型幻觉；具备分层委派、状态隔离与确定性验证闭环的架构，才是可工程化的复杂系统。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>上下文压缩的物理代价：KV Cache 压力、注意力衰减与有损摘要</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/claude-code-context-compression/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/claude-code-context-compression/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大模型在物理底层不存在真正意义上的生物记忆，只有在显卡高带宽内存（HBM）中随序列长度线性堆叠的 Key-Value Cache，以及在数学上随序列拉长而被急剧稀释的注意力权重分布。Claude Code 呈现给开发者的所谓长程对话能力，本质上是一套在硬件显存与精度边界夹缝中运行的缓存逐出流水线，伴随着不可逆的信息失真与前缀失效代价。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>MCP 实现 Claude Skills 渐进式披露：Skill in Anywhere</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/mcp-claude-skills-progressive-disclosure/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/mcp-claude-skills-progressive-disclosure/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="Claude Code Skill in Anywhere"&#10; width="2560"&#10; height="1440"&#10; src="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_3030e75c3d7e5ea7.png"&#10; srcset="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_3030e75c3d7e5ea7.png 800w,/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_48299efe0d2363fe.png 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills.png"&#10; /&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;Claude Code Skill in Anywhere&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;利用 MCP 实现 Claude Skills 的渐进式披露机制: 复用 Claude Code Skill in Anywhere&#10; &lt;div id="利用-mcp-实现-claude-skills-的渐进式披露机制-复用-claude-code-skill-in-anywhere" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e5%88%a9%e7%94%a8-mcp-%e5%ae%9e%e7%8e%b0-claude-skills-%e7%9a%84%e6%b8%90%e8%bf%9b%e5%bc%8f%e6%8a%ab%e9%9c%b2%e6%9c%ba%e5%88%b6-%e5%a4%8d%e7%94%a8-claude-code-skill-in-anywhere" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;—— 一种可行的能力封装与动态上下文扩展方案（技术设想与验证）&#10; &lt;div id="-一种可行的能力封装与动态上下文扩展方案技术设想与验证" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#-%e4%b8%80%e7%a7%8d%e5%8f%af%e8%a1%8c%e7%9a%84%e8%83%bd%e5%8a%9b%e5%b0%81%e8%a3%85%e4%b8%8e%e5%8a%a8%e6%80%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b8%8b%e6%96%87%e6%89%a9%e5%b1%95%e6%96%b9%e6%a1%88%e6%8a%80%e6%9c%af%e8%ae%be%e6%83%b3%e4%b8%8e%e9%aa%8c%e8%af%81" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;前言&#10; &lt;div id="前言" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e5%89%8d%e8%a8%80" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Claude Skills 引入了一个非常先进的概念：&#10;&lt;strong&gt;将专业知识、流程规范和任务方法封装成“技能包”，并在任务实际需要时才动态加载。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>